# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored — never commit a real key.

# Powers the "send to my inbox" button in the Stash email section
# (app/api/send-stash-email/route.ts). Without it that endpoint returns a 503
# and the form shows its error state; nothing else on the site is affected.
#
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com and create an API key.
# 2. Paste it below.
# Until a domain is verified, Resend's shared sender only delivers to the
# address that owns the key — fine for local testing, not for real visitors.
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to "Stash <onboarding@resend.dev>" (Resend's shared
# sender). Once you've verified a domain at https://resend.com/domains, set
# this to an address on it so the send works for anyone.
# STASH_FROM_EMAIL="Stash <hello@yourdomain.com>"
